  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Start Alert 1096 - Anticipation of Ebola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to strengthen Ebola preparedness and reduce the risk of disease transmission in high-risk communities through a combination of risk communication and community engagement (RCCE), infection prevention and control (IPC), hygiene promotion, and community-based surveillance activities. The intervention will provide hygiene facilities and supplies, disseminate Ebola prevention messages through multiple channels, train healthcare workers and community volunteers, and establish feedback mechanisms to support accountability and adaptive management.</narrative>
  </description>
